1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,800
Huh?

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,300
Ah...

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,800
Ah!

4
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:08,700
Ah!

5
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,300
Impossible!

6
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,500
Th-The Lens...

7
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:08,000
Um... who are you?

8
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:14,500
A hero... Yes. I'm searching for a hero.

9
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,300
One who will go down in history...
No—one capable of changing history itself.

10
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:25,300
A hero? A hero!
Then you've already found one!

11
00:01:27,700 --> 00:01:28,900
You?

12
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:33,200
Yeah! I'm not one yet, but someday...

13
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,650
No—I'll definitely become a great hero!

14
00:01:35,700 --> 00:01:43,000
Here's proof! Look at this birthmark.
It's in the same spot as my dad's.

15
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:46,000
I'm Kyle Dunamis. Nice to meet you.
What's your name?

16
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:48,900
Where did you come from?

17
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:56,300
And what brings you to
the world's next great hero?

18
00:01:56,300 --> 00:02:00,400
If someone needs my help, then—

19
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,600
H-Hey, wait!

20
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:06,600
You're no hero.

21
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:11,000
I can tell.

22
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:21,200
"You can tell"? How!?

23
00:02:21,300 --> 00:02:27,100
You're not the hero I'm searching for.
